Homepage: https://sparkylinux.org

Package: sparky-stereo-live-captions
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, procps, systemd, captiond (>= 0.1.0), kaption (>= 0.1.0),
 sparky-stereo-partners (>= 0.1.3), sparky-stereo-vibe (>= 0.1.1),
 sparky-stereo-problems (>= 0.2.1), qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs
Enhances: vibe
Description: live captions and a shared speech model through Partners
 Starts Kaption and captiond together when chosen in System Settings,
 shares a verified Whisper file with Vibe, and reports recognition device
 changes and measured delays. Audio and captions stay on this computer.
 Nothing starts or downloads a model at installation. Login startup and
 microphone captions are separate choices. Existing personal data is kept.
